  "slug": "confuzzled",
  "name": "ConFuzzled",
  "shortName": "CFz",
  "description": "ConFuzzled is an annual furry convention in England for adults aged 18 and over. The first edition took place in June 2008 at YHA Manchester, and the event stayed in Manchester until 2011 before moving to the Barceló Hinckley Island Hotel in Leicestershire for 2012 and 2013. Since 2014 it has been held at the Hilton Birmingham Metropole, close to the National Exhibition Centre. The 2020 and 2021 editions were replaced by online events. Its organisers describe it as the UK's largest furry convention, and the 2026 edition counted 3,225 attendees. Each year it supports an animal charity; the official tally passed £377,000 by 2026, with a high of £41,224 in 2025.",
  "blueskyHandle": "confuzzled.org.uk",
